=20

=E2=80=A2 The full N461 Judicial Review bundle (single PDF) was filed earlier tod=
ay

=E2=80=A2 The N463 urgent application was originally filed on 25 November 2025

=E2=80=A2 The Defendants were served on 27 November 2025

=E2=80=A2 The Administrative Court Listing Office also received the filing

=20

I attach again the single consolidated PDF bundle for ease of reference.

=20

Given my clinically urgent medical circumstances, evidenced by my physician=
