=20

Dear Listing Officer,

=20

I write to request urgent listing of my Judicial Review claim Zahmoul v Sec=
retary of State for Justice & HMCTS, for which the full N461 bundle was file=
d earlier today.

=20

I am a vulnerable litigant in person, and I attach the signed medical repor=
t from my treating physician, Dr Bruce Hayse, confirming:
I am in a state of acute psychiatric risk,
the stress arising from administrative uncertainty is materially worsening =
my condition,
and that urgent judicial consideration is clinically necessary to prevent f=
urther deterioration.
=20

Dr Hayse explicitly states that hospital admission may be required if this =
matter is not addressed promptly.

=20

Given the medical urgency, the disability-related risks, and the fact that =
the N461 claim and N463 urgent application are now fully filed, I respectful=
ly request that this matter is:
Referred immediately to the urgent judge, and
Given an expedited listing, as sought in Section 3 of the N463 form.
=20

I would be grateful for confirmation that the Listing Office has received t=
his escalation and that the matter is now with a judge.

=20

Kind regards,

Nadia Zahmoul

Litigant in Person

